      "widgets_values": [
        "qwen3-tts-voice-clone",
        "Qwen3-TTS Voice Clone",
        "text-to-speech",
        "",
        "Generate speech locally in the voice of one audio reference, transcribed automatically for voice conditioning.",
        "Qwen",
        "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base",
        "The prompt is the exact text to speak. Set language to the target language; voice direction belongs in instruct, not in the spoken text. For long narration, generate sentence or paragraph sections, reuse the same voice, and assemble the audio before generating video. Supply exactly one clean audio reference in input_audios, a few seconds of one speaker cut between sentences. It is transcribed automatically for voice conditioning. The prompt supplies the new words, not the reference."
      ]
